        "description": {
            "value": "<p>This <em>+1 striking returning starknife</em> is made of dark blue metal overlaid with smoky flecks of fused quartz. When you Cast a Spell and deal damage, your next attack before the end of your turn with this starknife ignores standard and lesser cover.</p>\n<p><strong>Activate—Points of Light</strong> <span class=\"action-glyph\">r</span> (concentrate, spirit)</p>\n<p><strong>Frequency</strong> once per 10 minutes</p>\n<p><strong>Trigger</strong> You successfully Strike a creature with a thrown Strike with the guiding starknife</p><hr /><p><strong>Effect</strong> The guiding starknife's blades detach, form into darts of starlight, and deal @Damage[4[piercing],1d4[spirit]] damage to the creature you just hit. This damage increases to @Damage[6[piercing],1d4[spirit]] with a greater striking rune and to @Damage[8[piercing],1d4[spirit]] with a major striking rune. The guiding starknife then re-forms and returns to your hand. Until the start of your next turn, the damaged creature is outlined with soft light and can't gain the effects of concealment.</p>"
